<title>USA: Grossman's chairman assumes CEO role.</title>
<headline>Grossman's chairman assumes CEO role.</headline>
<dateline>CANTON, Mass. 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grossman's Inc said on Friday it named chairman Robert Swanson as chief executive, replacing Sydney Katz.</p>
<p>Katz, who was president and chief executive, will take early retirement effective immediately, the company said.</p>
<p>Stanley Berman has been named president and chief operating officer, the company said.</p>
<p>Berman has served as a consultant to the company since 1991 after a career at Grossman's that started in 1953, the company said.</p>
